  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expanding the role of Ghanaians in sea turtle conservation activities in central Ghana, Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will implement daily night patrols on 10 km of sea turtle nesting beach within the Muni-Pomadze Ramsar site November 15, 2017 -February 28 to protect nests and nesting females; conduct sea turtle conservation education programs in local communities and weekly radio programs about wildlife conservation; train community members to conduct sea turtle surveys and ecotourism turle walks; and train 15 community members as observers to collect sea turtle bycatch data on local artisanal fishing boats.</narrative>
  </description>
